# Agent configuration is code (rule 18 in the ai-playbook): hooks run on
# every session, settings change what the agent may do without asking, and
# CLAUDE.md is instructions. On this one-person repository GitHub counts the
# owner as satisfied without a review, so the CI step "Agent configuration
# changes" and the owner's reading of each flagged file carry the rule; this
# file records who that is.

/.claude/                @rydncn
/.mcp.json               @rydncn
CLAUDE.md                @rydncn
AGENTS.md                @rydncn
/.github/workflows/      @rydncn
/.github/CODEOWNERS      @rydncn
/.devcontainer/          @rydncn
